      },
      "detail": "Changing revalidate(&mut self) to revalidate(&self) leaves the unchanged original `let mut owner` only called through a shared receiver, predicting unused_mut under strict warnings. No compile/lint run was performed. Preserve original public signature and offer a distinct shared probe if retaining all original fixture bytes and API shape is required.",
      "status": "SOURCE_REPAIRED_AND_INDEPENDENTLY_REVIEWED_NOT_EXECUTED",
